1
00:00:00,346 --> 00:00:02,146
(Sheldon:)and not the much more
ominous "hello."

2
00:00:03,783 --> 00:00:04,783
(Penny:)What's going on?

3
00:00:04,784 --> 00:00:06,254
(Sheldon:)I'm mad at Amy.

4
00:00:06,252 --> 00:00:10,192
(Penny:)Did she leave pit stains
in your favorite crop top, too?

5
00:00:10,189 --> 00:00:12,859
(Sheldon:)No.

6
00:00:12,858 --> 00:00:16,358
(Sheldon:)She helped Barry Kripke make
an advancement in string theory.

7
00:00:16,362 --> 00:00:18,492
(Penny:)Oh, that sounds
like a good thing.

8
00:00:18,497 --> 00:00:21,367
(Sheldon:)Well, it would be,
except that I left string theory

9
00:00:21,367 --> 00:00:23,367
(Sheldon:)because I decided
it was a dead end.

10
00:00:23,369 --> 00:00:25,539
(Sheldon:)Yeah, and then she went
behind my back

11
00:00:25,538 --> 00:00:27,408
(Sheldon:)to help someone else
prove me wrong.

12
00:00:27,406 --> 00:00:29,076
(Sheldon:)My rival, no less.

13
00:00:32,712 --> 00:00:34,442
(grunts)

14
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,920
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry you had to see that.

15
00:00:42,922 --> 00:00:46,292
(Penny:)I'm sorry I didn't have
a camera.

16
00:00:46,292 --> 00:00:48,292
(Sheldon:)Why would she
do this to me?

17
00:00:48,294 --> 00:00:50,964
(Penny:)Well, I'm sure she didn't
upset you on purpose.

18
00:00:50,963 --> 00:00:52,463
(Penny:)Besides, aren't you
the one who says

19
00:00:52,465 --> 00:00:55,065
(Penny:)there's nothing more important
than the advancement of science?

20
00:00:55,067 --> 00:00:57,567
(Sheldon:)No, I said there's
nothing more important

21
00:00:57,570 --> 00:00:59,900
than me advancing science.

22
00:00:59,905 --> 00:01:01,875
(Penny:)All right, well, if I'm
understanding this right,

